\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 > Note: Up Collective does not publish a competitive landscape; the list below is built from third-party "best marketing communities" articles (The Marketing Meetup, The CMO, Heartwired Club, Marketful) and from the UK marketing-recruitment league tables (Front Recruitment, ZoomInfo). It is an analyst inference, not an Up Collective claim.\cb1 \
