\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Direct competitors \'96 paid marketing communities / memberships (UK-leaning):**\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **The Marketing Meetup (TMM)** \'97 Cambridge-founded, ~46,000\'9651,000 members globally; runs ~200 events/year; donation-based pricing for IRL events, free online webinars. Most direct community comparator but broader audience and lower price point.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **Pretty Little Marketer (PLM)** \'97 founded 2020 by Sophie Miller; 221,000+ LinkedIn followers; paid "PLM Insiders Club" membership; social-media-marketer focus rather than start-up generalist.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **Girls in Marketing** \'97 founded 2018 by Olivia Hanlon, women-in-marketing focus.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **Heartwired Club** \'97 small, paid, marketer-peer community.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **Exit Five** (Dave Gerhardt) \'97 B2B-marketer focus, US-led but with UK members; a counterpart to Big Up Club's B2C orientation.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 \'a0\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Direct competitors \'96 fractional marketing / start-up growth agencies (overlap with Brand Hackers):**\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - Generalist DTC/FMCG growth shops working with the same challenger-brand client base; from Brand Hackers' careers ad ("we're not your typical agency or a one-man show") the competitive frame is positioned against both traditional agencies and individual freelancer consultants.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 \'a0\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Direct competitors \'96 marketing recruitment (overlap with Up Talent):**\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **Major Players, Stopgap, EMR, Spotlight Recruitment, Aspire, Intelligent People, Kindred, Front Recruitment** are the established London marketing-recruitment players (per Front Recruitment's market round-up and ZoomInfo competitor lists). Up Talent is much smaller but differentiates on start-up specialism and community embeddedness.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 \'a0\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Indirect competitors:**\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - Free communities & networks (LinkedIn groups, Slack groups, Marketing Week's CMO Network).\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - Formal training providers: Mark Ritson's Mini MBA in Marketing, CIM, IDM, CXL.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - Founder peer networks: YPO, Helm, The Marketing Society's Brave Network.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
