\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Founder-led narrative.** Every brand site features Lottie Unwin personally, with the same origin story (P&G grad \uc0\u8594  Head of Marketing at PROPERCORN \u8594  lonely \u8594  started a supper club for marketers that became The Copy Club, then Up World). This personal narrative has been repeated in podcast appearances on *Out of Hours* (Acast), *People Doing Things* (Apple Podcasts), *Your Basket Is Empty* (Ep. 53), *Bunch* (Buzzsprout), *Badass Unicorn*, *Keep Optimising* (episode 162), and *Corporate Survival Club*. There is **no comparable founder presence for the other senior staff** named on the site (Jonny \'96 Head of Up World; Abbie \'96 Membership & Partnerships Manager; Marc \'96 Executive Assistant; Olivia \'96 Community Executive/Manager; Abby \'96 Community & Ops Assistant; Kasturi \'96 freelance copywriter; Alfie \'96 freelance web designer; and Laura at Up Talent), reinforcing the founder-led brand model.\cb1 \
