\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Vertical / category positioning.** The group is unmistakably **B2C-leaning and DTC/FMCG-native** \'97 Brand Hackers' case studies are dominated by food, drink, beauty and wellness consumer brands; Big Up Club's FAQ states bluntly *"Big Up Club is going to be focused on B2C brands\'85 The B2B journey is different."* This is a genuine differentiator vs. broader-church communities like TMM or B2B-anchored ones like Exit Five.\cb1 \
