\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Differentiation \'96 the "ecosystem" pitch.** Up Talent's site articulates the model most explicitly: *"As part of the Up World group, we are at the centre of the start-up marketing ecosystem."* The combined value proposition is that the same start-up marketer can (a) be developed via Up World, (b) hire fractional support via Brand Hackers, and (c) hire permanent staff via Up Talent \'97 a vertically integrated talent-and-training stack for one narrow ICP. Independent commentary on the *Bunch* podcast describes this approach as *"how community is the ultimate long game"* and as a *"business ecosystem\'85 with community at its heart."*\cb1 \
