\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Mission / values overlay.** Up World and Brand Hackers both state on their websites that **2% of all revenue, "now and always,"** is donated \'97 Up World cites the **Laadli Boarding Home in Jodhpur** (under the Sambhali Trust) supporting 18 girls' housing and education; Brand Hackers cites both the **Sambhali Trust and Luminary Bakery**. Up World's About page frames this as *"What keeps us going,"* and Brand Hackers ran a dedicated post titled *"Scaling brands, changing lives \'97 why giving back is part of who we are."* Other published values include open salaries (Brand Hackers' staff handbook is publicly linked from job ads), unlimited coaching via MoreHappi as an employee benefit, and remote-first working.\cb1 \
