\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 1. **Treat Olivia Pike as the operational gatekeeper of the Up World community, not a public-facing spokesperson.** Press, podcast and thought-leadership engagement should be routed to **Lottie Unwin (founder/CEO)** or \'97 for partnerships and sponsorship \'97 to **Abbie (Membership & Partnerships Manager, who explicitly owns Big Up Club sponsorship)**. Olivia is the right contact for member experience, onboarding, events delivery, Slack moderation, and operational logistics \'97 i.e. anything touching the 1,000+ Up Club members or the running of Up Fest.\cb1 \
