\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 2. **If pitching a partnership, lead with B2C/DTC fit and 2% give-back alignment.** The two strongest mission filters Up Collective applies in public are (a) consumer-brand relevance (Big Up Club is explicit that B2B is out of scope) and (b) the social-mission overlay. A pitch that pattern-matches on either angle will get more traction than a generic "marketing community" pitch.\cb1 \
