\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 3. **If benchmarking or competing, the truest direct comparators are The Marketing Meetup (for community) and Major Players/Stopgap (for recruitment) \'97 but no single competitor replicates the three-brand ecosystem.** That integration is the moat; building a credible counter-offer means combining at least community + recruitment, not just one.\cb1 \
