\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **Olivia Pike's exact promotion date from "Community Executive" to "Community and Operations Manager" is unverified.** The Up World public team page (cached 2026 content) still lists her as "Community Executive"; her LinkedIn headline and the RocketReach record show the upgraded title. This is consistent with a recent internal promotion but no announcement was found.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **No press, podcast, interview, by-lined article, conference talk or quoted media appearance featuring Olivia Pike personally was discoverable** in the searches conducted. All visible thought-leadership and media output from the Up Collective is fronted by founder Lottie Unwin. Any briefing should assume Olivia Pike has limited external public profile relative to the founder.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **Member counts, revenue donation claims, audience-size claims and client case-study results are all self-reported on the group's own websites.** None have been independently audited in any source found. The 2% donation policy specifically should be taken at face-value as a stated policy; no third-party charity-registry confirmation was located in this research.\cb1 \
