\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **The legal entity** behind the trading names "Up Collective," "Up World," "Brand Hackers" and "Up Talent" appears to be **Copy Club Ltd (UK Co. No. 11449958)** based on the Brand Hackers website footer ("Copy Club Ltd T/A Brand Hackers") and the Up World footer (same company number). This was not separately confirmed via Companies House in this research.\cb1 \
