\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 - **"Up Collective" is a name collision.** A separate, unrelated organisation at up-collective.com (the UP Collective) is an international livelihood programme for refugee entrepreneurs co-founded by Ben & Jerry's and TERN in 2017. It has no connection to Lottie Unwin's Up Collective / Up World / Brand Hackers / Up Talent, and should not be confused with it.\cb1 \
